WEBVTT

00:02:27.975 --> 00:02:31.055
Wote tunajua kutoka katika uzoefu inakuaje.

00:02:31.055 --> 00:02:33.451
Tunapata hali fulani

00:02:33.451 --> 00:02:36.569
ambayo ina thamani kwetu.

00:02:36.569 --> 00:02:41.925
Tunapata kitu chenye thamani.

00:02:41.925 --> 00:02:43.871
na kweli tunapata.

00:02:43.871 --> 00:02:46.114
Vitu hivi viwili vinatakiwa kuja pamoja.

00:02:46.114 --> 00:02:49.636
Inatakiwa kuwa na thamani,

00:02:49.636 --> 00:02:51.524
na ni zawadi halisi.

00:02:51.524 --> 00:02:54.761
Hujainunua.Hujaitolea jasho.

00:02:54.761 --> 00:02:57.082
Hujaifanyia biashara.Hujaifanyia kazi.

00:02:57.082 --> 00:02:58.821
Umepewa tu.

00:02:58.821 --> 00:03:01.088
na hivi vitu viwili vinapokuja pamoja,